# Build outputs and local state never enter an image's build context.
**/target
**/node_modules
**/.test-out
**/__pycache__
client/dist
bench/results
tests/fuzz/corpus
tests/fuzz/artifacts
tests/fuzz/results
tests/fuzz/coverage
.git
# What no image reads, so a change to it rebuilds nothing: the documentation and the static pages, the installer, the
# Compose files, the public demo's installation, CI, and the scripts (but the two the display's build runs).
docs
site
*.md
LICENSE
install.sh
compose*.yaml
demo
.github
scripts
!scripts/svt-av1.sh
!scripts/opus.sh
# Host inputs: the upstream proxies' credentials (compose.egress.yaml) and Compose's variables.
egress.json
.env
# Images take their toolchain from the pinned rust base image; the file's extra components would need the network.
rust-toolchain.toml
